**Protect sensitive data**

```sql
CREATE MASKING POLICY email_mask AS (v STRING) RETURNS STRING ->
  CASE WHEN CURRENT_ROLE() IN ('ADMIN') THEN v ELSE REGEXP_REPLACE(v, '.+@', '***@') END;
ALTER TABLE users MODIFY COLUMN email SET MASKING POLICY email_mask;
```

- **Row access policies** filter rows per role
- **Object tagging** and automatic **classification** find PII
